Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.57,0:00:09.03,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU, YAMU, YAMU, YAMU, YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.17,0:00:31.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Y 'all move!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.99,0:01:04.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Attention, duelists!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.57,0:01:07.59,Default,,0,0,0,,We are now back on course\Nto Kymotorp Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.67,0:01:11.09,Default,,0,0,0,,for the conclusion of\Nthe Battle City Finals.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.75,0:01:13.11,Default,,0,0,0,,This is it, Mokuba.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.57,0:01:17.03,Default,,0,0,0,,There are only four finalists\Nleft, including myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.59,0:01:18.75,Default,,0,0,0,,And before long,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.91,0:01:23.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be crowned the world's greatest\Nduelist on top of my Duel Tower. Plus,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.69,0:01:25.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll have the most powerful deck in Duel
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.79,0:01:29.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Monsters once I win the\Nthree Egyptian God Cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.83,0:01:33.79,Default,,0,0,0,,When I defeat Marek, I'll\Nget his winged dragon of Ra,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.19,0:01:36.27,Default,,0,0,0,,which seems to be the most powerful of the
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.35,0:01:40.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Three Egyptian god cards. Then\NI'll gain Slifer, the Sky Dragon,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.85,0:01:42.05,Default,,0,0,0,,when I wipe out Yugi
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.43,0:01:49.37,Default,,0,0,0,,And since I already possess the\Nmighty obelisk, the tormentor,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.71,0:01:52.43,Default,,0,0,0,,my deck will be completely unstoppable And
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.51,0:01:55.03,Default,,0,0,0,,then I'll be respected and feared by every
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.11,0:01:59.27,Default,,0,0,0,,duelist on earth Not\Nagain And now it's only
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.35,0:02:02.89,Default,,0,0,0,,a matter of time before\Nthe winner takes all.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.45,0:02:07.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Joey. Hey, sis.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.47,0:02:08.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Has Mai said a word?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.71,0:02:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Mm-mm.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.62,0:02:13.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I still can't believe Marek trapped\Nher mind in the Shadow Room. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.91,0:02:15.75,Default,,0,0,0,,What did she ever do to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.95,0:02:17.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Mai. Wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.05,0:02:21.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me what you did to\Nher right now, Marek.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.97,0:02:25.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Your friend made a costly\Nmistake by dueling against me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.63,0:02:28.49,Default,,0,0,0,,And now she's paying the ultimate price.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.75,0:02:33.34,Default,,0,0,0,,She'll forget more with each passing\Nsecond until the shadows engulf her mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.61,0:02:35.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about a thing, Mai.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.83,0:02:36.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.15,0:02:38.77,Default,,0,0,0,,If losing to Marek got you there,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.85,0:02:41.63,Default,,0,0,0,,then maybe if I defeat\NMarek, it'll bring you back.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.71,0:02:43.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Just promise me you'll be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.77,0:02:45.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, that's my middle name.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.51,0:02:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,My brother must be saved from\Nthe evil that's controlling him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.95,0:02:51.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It's you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.86,0:02:52.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.95,0:02:57.23,Default,,0,0,0,,and I've come here to get some vital\Ninformation from you concerning your friend,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.31,0:02:58.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Odeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.22,0:02:59.77,Default,,0,0,0,,What have you done with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.77,0:03:01.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.71,0:03:04.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I can see through your lies. It's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.95,0:03:08.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Odeon has the power to stop\Nme, so you're protecting him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.57,0:03:12.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if I was, Merrick, you're\Nthe last person I would tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.49,0:03:14.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Care to reconsider those words?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.97,0:03:15.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.45,0:03:19.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Without your Millennium\NNecklace, you're powerless.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.55,0:03:23.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, take it, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.91,0:03:26.01,Default,,0,0,0,,My Millennium Necklace is yours now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.09,0:03:30.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Were you foolish enough to lose the one\Nthing that could have protected you from me?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.73,0:03:34.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Not only did your Millennium\NNecklace allow you to see the future,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.89,0:03:37.43,Default,,0,0,0,,it also shielded you from my shadow magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.81,0:03:40.65,Default,,0,0,0,,So are you going to tell\Nme where you hid Odeon?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.79,0:03:43.37,Default,,0,0,0,,or shall I send you to the Shadow Rail?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.87,0:03:46.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, is that fear I see in your eyes?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.91,0:03:49.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I must say I like this side of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.75,0:03:54.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Now then, I have a tournament to\Nwin, so I'll deal with you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.01,0:03:59.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Attention duelists!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.61,0:04:03.35,Default,,0,0,0,,We're six miles from Kaibakorp\NIsland, preparing for descent.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.89,0:04:09.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Once I win this tournament, I'm coming\Nback to finish our conversation, Ishizu.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.13,0:04:13.15,Default,,0,0,0,,So I wouldn't get too\Ncomfortable if I were you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.39,0:04:18.47,Default,,0,0,0,,For once I acquire the two remaining\NEgyptian God cards and the Millennium Puzzle,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.55,0:04:21.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll focus my attention\Non banishing you and that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.93,0:04:26.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Fool Odeon to the shadows.\NNow if you'll excuse me,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.35,0:04:29.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to strip the former\Npharaoh of all his powers
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.73,0:04:33.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I must say it's been\Nlovely chatting with you,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.91,0:04:38.91,Default,,0,0,0,,sister And I'm looking forward to spending\Nmore time with you in the days to come
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.25,0:04:41.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Good day
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.89,0:04:48.23,Default,,0,0,0,,This tournament is getting too dangerous\NNow Bakura's in the Shadow Realm,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.31,0:04:49.27,Default,,0,0,0,,thanks to Merrick.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.35,0:04:50.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.37,0:04:53.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone who's dueled with\NMerrick has paid a large price.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.51,0:04:55.23,Default,,0,0,0,,First, Odeon was struck down.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.53,0:04:59.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Then Mai's mind was trapped in the\NShadow Realm, and now Bakura's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.81,0:05:02.25,Default,,0,0,0,,So, how long have you been here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.37,0:05:04.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me what you've done with Bakura.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.47,0:05:06.63,Default,,0,0,0,,If you mean the spirit of the ring,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.87,0:05:12.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You should know what fate befalls someone\Nunfortunate enough to lose a Shadow Game.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.67,0:05:15.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure Merrick's already\Nplanning his next move.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.39,0:05:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Why should my friends have to\Nsuffer when it's me he wants?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.09,0:05:20.49,Default,,0,0,0,,He wants us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.81,0:05:22.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What's he waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.35,0:05:26.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I think that Merrick's trying to weaken\Nus by targeting our friends, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.61,0:05:30.27,Default,,0,0,0,,He knows that to take the Millennium\NPuzzle and our Egyptian God card,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.35,0:05:31.91,Default,,0,0,0,,he must first defeat us in a duel,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.99,0:05:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,so he's taking down our friends one by\None in order to crush our confidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.75,0:05:38.87,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't let him get away with that!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.75,0:05:40.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.99,0:05:44.05,Default,,0,0,0,,If Merrick thinks he can bully us\Naround with his Millennium Rod,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.13,0:05:45.31,Default,,0,0,0,,he better think again!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.39,0:05:47.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Because you and I are going\Nto win this tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.73,0:05:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,and hopefully when we do,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.41,0:05:53.59,Default,,0,0,0,,and Merrick's plan fails, everyone\Nwho fell victim to him will be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.91,0:05:55.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I know we can do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.67,0:05:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.77,0:06:00.73,Default,,0,0,0,,When we work together,\Nthere's no stopping us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.97,0:06:05.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Just as Ashizu told us, we have to win\Nthis tournament and save the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.59,0:06:09.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.87,0:06:11.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It's almost that time, dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.69,0:06:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,So grab your dueling deck and let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.13,0:06:16.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.55,0:06:19.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakura's in no shape\Nto be out of bed, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.19,0:06:20.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he was looking pretty bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.05,0:06:22.93,Default,,0,0,0,,He's, uh, just getting some air.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.69,0:06:28.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Joey and I have some duels to\Nwin, and we need your help. You bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.27,0:06:30.17,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be right there on the sidelines.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.25,0:06:32.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You can count on us, for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.89,0:06:35.63,Default,,0,0,0,,We are now beginning our\Ndescent upon Kyber Corp
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.71,0:06:38.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Island for the conclusion\Nof the Battle City Finals.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.87,0:06:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,When we touch down, please exit the\Naircraft and await further instructions.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.57,0:06:50.83,Default,,0,0,0,,The moment I've been\Nwaiting for is finally here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.91,0:06:54.21,Default,,0,0,0,,soon i'll be crowned the\Nworld's greatest duelist
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.29,0:06:57.77,Default,,0,0,0,,whoa check it out guys\Nthat must be the dual tower
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.85,0:07:01.33,Default,,0,0,0,,kaiba was yapping about\Nnow what i'm sure we'll
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.41,0:07:05.51,Default,,0,0,0,,find out soon enough look\Nthe island we're standing
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.59,0:07:08.15,Default,,0,0,0,,on is the site of the\Noriginal kaiba corporation
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.23,0:07:12.51,Default,,0,0,0,,but i tore it down and is\Nthat yes that's my dual
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.59,0:07:15.37,Default,,0,0,0,,tower and i plan to to\Ndefeat you on the very top,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.45,0:07:16.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.13,0:07:20.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, rich boy,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.51,0:07:24.89,Default,,0,0,0,,in case you forgot, I'm in this tournament\Ntoo, and you won't be getting past me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.97,0:07:26.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll duel so many circles around you,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.05,0:07:29.45,Default,,0,0,0,,you won't know your trap\Ncards from your graveyard,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.53,0:07:30.36,Default,,0,0,0,,punk.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.44,0:07:33.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Must you insist on\Nembarrassing yourself, Wheeler?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.59,0:07:36.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't even be in\Nmy tournament, you amateur.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.11,0:07:37.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.02,0:07:39.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, calm down, champ.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.83,0:07:40.87,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.11,0:07:42.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You want a piece of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.35,0:07:43.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.71,0:07:45.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Save it for your duel, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.57,0:07:48.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, use all of that anger\Nto beat Kaiba in the finals.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.85,0:07:49.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.76,0:07:51.61,Default,,0,0,0,,We're wasting time, so let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.61,0:08:00.37,Default,,0,0,0,,It's such a lovely day, isn't it, Pharaoh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.83,0:08:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Too bad some of your friends can't enjoy\Nit from all the way in the Shadow Realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.73,0:08:08.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, auto-joke-head!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.45,0:08:09.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going down!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.79,0:08:11.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let's get on with these duels.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.35,0:08:15.21,Default,,0,0,0,,When do I find out who my next victim is?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.29,0:08:18.23,Default,,0,0,0,,just chill out we'll\Ntell you inside the tower
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.31,0:08:22.29,Default,,0,0,0,,is that clear then why don't we proceed so
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.37,0:08:26.97,Default,,0,0,0,,the fun can begin so\Nwhat's inside this thing
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.75,0:08:30.59,Default,,0,0,0,,why don't you try listening\Nfor a change wheeler
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.67,0:08:35.37,Default,,0,0,0,,your attention please\Nstep to the center of
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.45,0:08:37.91,Default,,0,0,0,,the tower the second\Nhalf of the battle city
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.99,0:08:41.29,Default,,0,0,0,,finals will take place right\Nhere so far it's not so
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.99,0:08:42.82,Default,,0,0,0,,impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.90,0:08:45.69,Default,,0,0,0,,This place doesn't look like\Na dueling arena. Oh yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.95,0:08:47.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Just wait and see.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.53,0:08:50.35,Default,,0,0,0,,As you know, there are\Nfour finalists remaining.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.73,0:08:54.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, Joey, Merrick, and\Nof course, Mr. Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.49,0:08:57.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll notice we're\Nsurrounded by four doors.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.21,0:09:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Each finalist must choose a\Ndoor through which to enter.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.65,0:09:01.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Choose wisely.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.69,0:09:03.01,Default,,0,0,0,,What's behind them?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.15,0:09:12.69,Default,,0,0,0,,The Battle City Finals.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.01,0:09:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You geek.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.92,0:09:35.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I choose you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.85,0:09:37.01,Default,,0,0,0,,We have a winner.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.91,0:09:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.85,0:09:42.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I already called first dibs on that door.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.39,0:09:44.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Just choose the door closest to you, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.77,0:09:47.93,Default,,0,0,0,,But what about my potato song?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.45,0:09:50.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.49,0:09:52.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess if you've seen one\Ndoor, you've seen them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.03,0:09:55.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone else, come on and follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.57,0:09:56.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Too bad, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.97,0:09:59.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess door choosing's not your thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.11,0:10:00.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Good luck, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.21,0:10:03.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I suppose I should stand on that platform.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.27,0:10:05.21,Default,,0,0,0,,But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.51,0:10:06.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What is Kaiba planning?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.61,0:10:10.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Are we dueling in these?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.73,0:10:19.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.19,0:10:21.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.10,0:10:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I can barely see the top of this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.15,0:10:24.49,Default,,0,0,0,,So what gives, Mokuba?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.93,0:10:27.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you mind telling us\Nwhere the duelists are?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.69,0:10:29.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, here they come right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.23,0:10:33.17,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.69,0:10:40.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it looks like the gang's all here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.77,0:10:42.25,Default,,0,0,0,,So, what's the deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.47,0:10:44.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this some kind of a four-way duel?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.97,0:10:49.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Roland will explain the rules, and I've\Nasked him to speak slowly so you can follow.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.67,0:10:50.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You're lucky I'm over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.05,0:10:53.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Before the winner of the Battle\NCity Tournament can be crowned,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.97,0:10:56.21,Default,,0,0,0,,we must first narrow down the finalists.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.29,0:11:00.94,Default,,0,0,0,,So in the semi-final round, the four\Nremaining duelists will be reduced to two.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.13,0:11:04.63,Default,,0,0,0,,But first, gentlemen, the\Npreliminary duel must be played.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.97,0:11:08.95,Default,,0,0,0,,This special duel will determine\Nwho faces who in the semifinals,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.03,0:11:12.41,Default,,0,0,0,,and all four duelists will\Nparticipate at one time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.61,0:11:15.85,Default,,0,0,0,,As you lose life points, your\Nterminal will climb higher.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.93,0:11:20.21,Default,,0,0,0,,The first two duelists to reach the\Ntop will face each other in round one.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.29,0:11:21.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.20,0:11:23.39,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a duel to see who duels.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.57,0:11:28.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Each duelist will begin with 4,000\Nlife points, And when it's your turn,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.25,0:11:30.60,Default,,0,0,0,,you can attack any of the other players.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.21,0:11:33.45,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, for some new regulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.89,0:11:37.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You must all limit your dueling\Ndecks to no more than 40 cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.91,0:11:40.26,Default,,0,0,0,,So take this time to prepare your decks.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.21,0:11:44.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, connect your duel discs\Nto the monitor in front of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.15,0:11:48.56,Default,,0,0,0,,This screen will display the\Nimages of the cards you play.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.61,0:11:54.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember, winning or losing this duel has\Nno effect on how you place in the finals.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.57,0:11:57.89,Default,,0,0,0,,This is simply a strategic\Nway to determine who
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.97,0:12:00.75,Default,,0,0,0,,your opponent will be\Nin the semi-final round.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.25,0:12:04.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Again, this duel will not\Naffect your overall placement.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.97,0:12:07.53,Default,,0,0,0,,That's good, so at least\Nall the pressure's off.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.61,0:12:11.85,Default,,0,0,0,,because it doesn't really matter who wins\Nand who loses in this duel, right, guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.93,0:12:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not exactly true.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.45,0:12:16.63,Default,,0,0,0,,This could be the most\Nimportant duel these guys play.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.79,0:12:18.73,Default,,0,0,0,,And how do you figure that, Duke?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.97,0:12:21.37,Default,,0,0,0,,They can control who\Ntheir opponent will be,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.45,0:12:24.07,Default,,0,0,0,,so they might change\Ntheir strategies depending
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.15,0:12:27.03,Default,,0,0,0,,on who they want to face\Nin the semi-final round.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.71,0:12:30.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Two duelists can even gang\Nup on one if they want.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.91,0:12:31.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Gang up, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.13,0:12:36.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder which one of those guys is in\Ndanger of getting double teamed, Taya.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.69,0:12:39.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Knowing Joey's luck, they'll go after him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.15,0:12:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.47,0:12:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.39,0:12:42.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You talking about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.73,0:12:45.39,Default,,0,0,0,,We were, uh, just making\Nup a cheer for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.55,0:12:46.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.67,0:12:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, but it better have\Nlots of cool rhymes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.91,0:12:52.69,Default,,0,0,0,,This entire duel was\Nset up to make us choose
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.77,0:12:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,the opponents we'll\Nface in the semifinals.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.63,0:12:57.07,Default,,0,0,0,,But who should I pick?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.89,0:13:02.95,Default,,0,0,0,,In order to win this tournament\Nand all three Egyptian God Cards,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.15,0:13:05.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll have to face Merrick last.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.27,0:13:09.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Since his winged dragon of Rai is\Nthe most powerful of the three,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.09,0:13:11.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll need the other two\Nin my deck to win it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.83,0:13:13.91,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's where you come in, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.73,0:13:17.57,Default,,0,0,0,,It makes no difference who I duel next.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.65,0:13:21.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Either way, I'll drain the\Nbarrel of his powers in the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.57,0:13:27.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare yourselves, duelists.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.69,0:13:31.13,Default,,0,0,0,,The four-way battle is\Nabout to begin. Remember,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.39,0:13:33.49,Default,,0,0,0,,the first two duelists to lose their life
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.57,0:13:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,points will face each\Nother in the semi-finals.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.53,0:13:37.87,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.31,0:13:41.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Now to determine which duelist\Nwill make the first move.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.07,0:13:43.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't I just go first?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.69,0:13:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you pay attention\Nto the rules that Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.33,0:13:48.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba worked so hard to create?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.27,0:13:50.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you'll each draw\Na monster card and the
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.41,0:13:53.17,Default,,0,0,0,,attack points will\Ndetermine who goes first.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.53,0:13:57.06,Default,,0,0,0,,However, the monster you choose\Ncannot be used in this duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.29,0:14:01.13,Default,,0,0,0,,So if I want to go first, I have\Nto sacrifice a powerful monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.39,0:14:04.79,Default,,0,0,0,,In order to ensure that I\Nface Yugi in the semi-finals,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.91,0:14:06.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll need to make the first move.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.77,0:14:11.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Should I pick that card? Or this one?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.37,0:14:13.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh, Joey looks a bit freaked out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.09,0:14:16.57,Default,,0,0,0,,It is now time to reveal your cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.41,0:14:20.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, hold them up so all\Nthe players can view them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.27,0:14:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like my card is the most\Npowerful, so I get to start things off.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.91,0:14:32.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna save all my\Nbest cards for the duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.95,0:14:35.01,Default,,0,0,0,,The results have been tallied.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.23,0:14:37.49,Default,,0,0,0,,The order of duelists is as follows.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.57,0:14:38.59,Default,,0,0,0,,First, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.73,0:14:42.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba, and then Marek,\Nthen Yugi, and then Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.81,0:14:45.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything is going according to plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.41,0:14:48.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll spare Yugi so I can\Nface him in the semifinals.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.85,0:14:52.13,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'll focus all my\Nattention on eliminating Marek.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.97,0:14:55.44,Default,,0,0,0,,And getting rid of Wheeler will be simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.65,0:15:01.25,Default,,0,0,0,,As much as I want to crush Kaiba and put\Nan end to his insults once and for all,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.33,0:15:03.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I have more important\Nreasons for being here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.71,0:15:07.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I promised Yugi and mine that\NI would take Merrick down.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.83,0:15:10.48,Default,,0,0,0,,The entire world is\Ndepending on our victory.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.91,0:15:12.51,Default,,0,0,0,,But what if we fail?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.71,0:15:14.59,Default,,0,0,0,,The stakes are too high. Yugi,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.93,0:15:18.59,Default,,0,0,0,,we joined this tournament to\Nsave the world, and right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.67,0:15:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,that means stopping Merrick\Nfrom completing his evil plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.23,0:15:25.13,Default,,0,0,0,,So, letting him win is not an option.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.25,0:15:29.95,Default,,0,0,0,,My family has slaved for centuries,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.27,0:15:33.33,Default,,0,0,0,,protecting the tomb of the\NPharaoh until his return.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.71,0:15:34.67,Default,,0,0,0,,And for what?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.85,0:15:36.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I should be the pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.69,0:15:39.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I was raised on the ancient scriptures,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.41,0:15:43.63,Default,,0,0,0,,learning all there is to know about King\NYami the pharaoh and the shadow games.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.71,0:15:48.19,Default,,0,0,0,,The key to his power is your puzzle\Nand the three Egyptian god cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.43,0:15:51.75,Default,,0,0,0,,But I can't just take the\NMillennium Puzzle from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.95,0:15:55.79,Default,,0,0,0,,According to the ancient scriptures,\NI have to defeat you in a duel first.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.87,0:15:57.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll banish you to the Shadow Realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.99,0:15:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.39,0:16:02.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Once I gain control of\Nthe Millennium Puzzle
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.37,0:16:05.05,Default,,0,0,0,,and obtain all three Egyptian God Cards,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.27,0:16:06.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be king.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.37,0:16:11.85,Default,,0,0,0,,And my Millennium Rod will ensure\Nthat I get everything I need.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.21,0:16:16.35,Default,,0,0,0,,The fate of the entire world rests on\Nthe outcome of the Battle City Finals,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.43,0:16:17.93,Default,,0,0,0,,and we mustn't lose hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.53,0:16:21.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right, and together\Nyou and I can do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.09,0:16:25.31,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, enough waiting around.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.57,0:16:26.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's start this duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.93,0:16:28.45,Default,,0,0,0,,And now,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.73,0:16:33.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll place one card face down, and then\NI'll summon Force Raider in attack mode!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.13,0:16:35.59,Default,,0,0,0,,That ends my turn!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.09,0:16:39.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to make sure that Merrick\Nand Wheeler lose this duel,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.95,0:16:42.31,Default,,0,0,0,,or my entire plan is ruined!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.81,0:16:44.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Not bad, Seto Kaiba!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.87,0:16:48.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Then again, your monster's\Nno match for my new Doria!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.87,0:16:53.25,Default,,0,0,0,,That's all for now!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.33,0:16:56.75,Default,,0,0,0,,This creature's special ability\Nwill come in quite handy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.93,0:16:58.91,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, then. My move.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.91,0:17:03.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that eventually I'm\Ngoing to have to defeat Merrick,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.77,0:17:06.03,Default,,0,0,0,,but I'm still not sure who I should face
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.11,0:17:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,in the semifinals to\Nmake sure that happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.97,0:17:12.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I summon Big Shield Gardner\Nto the field in defense mode
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.53,0:17:16.77,Default,,0,0,0,,and place these face down.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.85,0:17:22.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Last but not least...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.23,0:17:25.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Aw, man, this hand is the pits.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.11,0:17:27.31,Default,,0,0,0,,But I gotta relax, play it cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.65,0:17:30.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll place one card face\Ndown and end my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.75,0:17:32.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Which brings it back to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.03,0:17:34.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Just as I suspected.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.83,0:17:36.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't belong here, Wheeler.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.93,0:17:41.61,Default,,0,0,0,,So I think I'll do us all a favor\Nand eliminate you from this duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.13,0:17:45.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Force Raider, attack his life points now!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.61,0:17:51.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey doesn't have any monsters\Non the field to protect him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.21,0:17:52.37,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.57,0:17:59.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Say goodbye to those light\Npoints. I'll protect you. And I'll
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.13,0:18:02.89,Default,,0,0,0,,do it by activating my trap\Ncard The Regulation of Tribe
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.19,0:18:13.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no Oh yes Thanks to this trap\Ncard I can stop the attack of
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.47,0:18:18.09,Default,,0,0,0,,one type of monster I choose\NBeast Warriors Like Force Raider
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.37,0:18:25.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Yook Joey, you and I are a\Nteam, and I'll always protect you.
